Error [E0749]: `rates` reaches the `FS.Read` effect, which module `pricing` denies
  --> tests/ui/effects/module_cap_denial_is_e0749.jet:5:8
    |
  5 |     fn rates() -> String { fs.read("rates.txt") ?? "" }
    |        ^^^^^
  --> tests/ui/effects/module_cap_denial_is_e0749.jet:3:1
    |
  3 | #FX(!Net, !FS)
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ module `pricing` is capped here
 Why: The module's `#FX(…)` cap denies `FS` to every function inside it and every callee it can reach
 Fix: Remove the call that introduces `FS.Read`, move `rates` out of module `pricing`, or drop `!FS` from the module's `#FX(…)` cap
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: rates
 Scope chain: module pricing
